# User Roles

Primary roles:

* Vendor: `lnkup_vendor`
* Organizer: `lnkup_organizer`
* Platform admin: `lnkup_admin`
* WordPress admin: `administrator`

Vendor dashboard must not show organizer-only functionality.

Organizer dashboard must not show vendor-only functionality.

Admin can bypass ownership checks only through approved capability helpers.

