# Stripe Connect Rules

LNKup is a marketplace.

Preferred Stripe Connect model:

* Express connected accounts
* Destination charges when organizer account is active
* LNKup retains platform fee
* Organizer receives net revenue
* Manual/internal fallback when organizer Connect onboarding is incomplete

Do not expose technical Stripe terms to users.

Avoid UI copy like:

```txt
Stripe Connect active · Settlement: destination
```

Use user-friendly copy:

```txt
Payouts Active
Your payout account is active. Vendor payments can be routed to your organizer balance.
```

If onboarding is incomplete:

```txt
Finish payout setup to cash out vendor revenue.
```

If Stripe is reviewing:

```txt
Stripe is reviewing your payout setup.
```

If restricted:

```txt
Stripe needs more information before payouts can be enabled.
```

Connect routes must never 500 because Connect is disabled. Return safe JSON:

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "code": "connect_not_configured",
  "message": "Stripe Connect is not configured yet.",
  "status": "not_started"
}
```

