# Marketplace Fee Rules

Launch pricing assumptions unless user says otherwise:

* Organizer platform fee: 4–5%
* Vendor marketplace fee: $5.99 on successful paid booking
* Free booths: $0 vendor marketplace fee

Build fee system to support later:

* flat fee
* percentage fee
* hybrid fee
* vendor-paid fee
* organizer-paid fee
* split fee
* brackets
* waivers
* promo codes
* referral credits

Do not hardcode fees in random UI files. Use financial settings or fee engine.

