# Growth System Rules

Growth dashboard must never fail completely because one module errors.

If any growth module returns `WP_Error`, convert to safe fallback data.

`/wp-json/lnkup/v1/growth/dashboard` should always return JSON.

For new vendors, return zero-state data:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "kpis": {
      "events_completed": 0,
      "applications_submitted": 0,
      "acceptance_rate": 0,
      "estimated_roi": 0,
      "profile_strength": 0
    },
    "recommendations": [],
    "goals": [],
    "roi": {
      "total_spend": 0,
      "estimated_revenue": 0,
      "profit_estimate": 0
    },
    "benchmarks": [],
    "profile_strength": {
      "score": 0,
      "missing_items": []
    },
    "calendar": [],
