# Find Events Marketplace Rules

Find Events is the core marketplace.

It should prioritize discovery and search.

The main results grid should be the focus.

Search ranking should prioritize:

1. exact title match
2. title starts with query
3. city/market match
4. event type/category match
5. description/body match
6. trending/recommended score

Event cards should show:

* title
* date
* city/state
* venue if available
* category/type badges
* booth fee
* attendance estimate
* spots remaining
* application deadline
* organizer verified badge
* Apply button
* Save/Favorite button

Apply button behavior:

* logged out: show login/register prompt
* vendor: open application form/modal
* organizer/admin: show "Only vendors can apply"
* already applied: show application status
* closed/full: show closed/full status
* success: show confirmation

Do not let Apply silently do nothing.

Explore More sections:

* Recommended
* Trending
* Closing Soon
* Most Applied
* Collections

Hide empty sections.

Do not show floating empty headings.

Collections should look like chips/cards, not broken text.

